<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Taita cuts nine-month losses.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Taita cuts nine-month losses.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 2,364   vs   2,704</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  -103   vs    -363</p>
<p>    Net profit				 -71   vs    -281</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Taita Chemical Co Ltd, one of Taiwan's leading makers of chemicals.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
